        "detailed_description": "<h1>Future Content</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/53175e231d95013a6d19a41b63fb9aa7.avif?t=1784621632\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME THE RENOVATION MASTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every forgotten bus in the scrapyard deserves a second chance. Take on renovation tasks from old friends and ambitious clients, transforming piles of rusty metal into stylish motorhomes or cozy mobile cafes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⠀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/bf289afdc69b32b8952f8cd0febe0fb2.poster.avif?t=1784621632\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/bf289afdc69b32b8952f8cd0febe0fb2.webm?t=1784621632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/bf289afdc69b32b8952f8cd0febe0fb2.mp4?t=1784621632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLEAN EVERYTHING AT YOUR OWN PACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feel the meditative rhythm of work as you wash away layers of dust. Dirty work becomes a satisfying hobby the moment you hear the steady hum of a renewed engine.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⠀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/3a3f7d22f148f0afbb8d7aac3a402937.poster.avif?t=1784621632\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/3a3f7d22f148f0afbb8d7aac3a402937.webm?t=1784621632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/3a3f7d22f148f0afbb8d7aac3a402937.mp4?t=1784621632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PUT YOUR HEART IN YOUR DESIGN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fill the interior with comfort and just go with the vibe. Choose furniture and materials to create the kind of atmosphere you would never want to leave.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⠀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/f4248b8c9216bfb635239d7fd06351f5.poster.avif?t=1784621632\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/f4248b8c9216bfb635239d7fd06351f5.webm?t=1784621632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/f4248b8c9216bfb635239d7fd06351f5.mp4?t=1784621632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENJOY THE CHILL RIDE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Once the tools are put away, the road is yours to explore. Free ride through beautiful landscapes and soak in the quiet beauty of the world passing by you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⠀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/f45c35f7f6744b27c9af1c0e495feea8.poster.avif?t=1784621632\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https:/